# What the lessons study (study/r1/lessons.md) found. Sources are under 2.10; the old body's own documents are 2.1.x; the critic's report is 2.31.

n: 3.7
name: lessons
kind: hub
is: The old body at b8ff978c9: 4,775 commits in five months, 2,572 files, 308,944 lines of .fk and .bml, and a C seed that went from 160 to 34,149 lines under a written rule that it shrinks. An 89% cut of files regrew by 55 to 58% in eight weeks. The study ranks twelve root causes, led by hand-kept copies of one meaning, meaning that changed with heat, value kinds read from number ranges, and failure recovered silently into a value. The owner's asks stayed constant from July. Evidence is git counts and dated notes; the old runtime was not run.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/lessons

n: 3.7.1
name: shape
kind: hub
is: The old repository measured with git and wc on 2026-11-24: its totals, the seed file's line count at nine samples beside the written rule that it shrinks, and the file cut of 2026-09-29 with the regrowth after it. Both the seed and the file count rose again after the one structural cut.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/lessons

n: 3.7.1.1
name: repository-totals
kind: observation
is: At commit b8ff978c9 the old body has 4,775 commits from 2026-06-28 to 2026-11-24 by 4 authors, a 1.43 GiB pack and 2,572 tracked files: 1,105 .bml, 974 .fk, 221 .md, 73 .jsonl. Its .fk and .bml files hold 308,944 lines; form/ alone holds 1,723 files; commits per month peak at 1,655 in September.
status: observed
