n: 3.7.2.6
name: reader-and-harness-accepted-failure
kind: observation
is: Until 2026-09-02 the old runtime ran only the last top-level form of a unit; its reader accepted a source missing a closing parenthesis and, before 2026-07-02, cut sources over 262,144 bytes. The validation script exited 0 on every run until 2026-09-11 and compared kernels with each other only: one band answered 42 against a declared 63 and passed.
status: observed
src: 2.10.16#11 2.10.17#41-46 2.10.18#17 2.10.19#11-17 2.10.19#57-59
