n: 3.7.2.7
name: dependencies-by-comment-and-order
kind: observation
is: In the old body a comment line '; preludes: a.fk, b.fk' was a load directive of one line; 151 band files that wrapped it loaded an empty list and ran without their dependencies. A loader's incidental prelude could satisfy a callee, a home-index.txt table linked units by called name, and fkwu and its siblings ran from different working directories.
status: observed
src: 2.10.15#9-37 2.10.8#19-23 2.10.20#30-33 2.10.21#70-71
