n: 3.7.2.9
name: node-identity-not-stable
kind: observation
is: In the old body a row built with raw-word children read back from disk as a different node, node_eq of built against read answering 0 (note of 2026-10-12). make_nodeid had no lookup: one category minted once per sample made 99.7% of the cells of the host-wide shared field, whose ceiling is 2^26 cells and in which nothing was ever freed.
