is: The old body passed JSON text between its parts and spawned itself as child processes, parsing stdout, stderr and exit code. The owner asked on 2026-10-08 and 2026-10-12 to remove JSON inside the system; on 2026-11-20 removal stood at layer 2a of 4 and 73 .jsonl files are tracked; str_find has 1,596 call sites in form-stdlib alone.
