n: 3.7.2.12
name: shared-state-across-checkouts
kind: observation
is: As witnessed on 2026-09-11, every checkout of the old body ran its own build of the runtime against one host-wide roster and one host-wide node field, so a fix on a branch reached no running kernel. Per-process report files were 7,329 of 7,403 entries in one worktree root on 2026-09-12, and a stale binary still passed the ground check while lacking newer evaluator capabilities.
