n: 3.7.2.14
name: fixed-capacities-and-switches
kind: observation
is: Fixed sizes sat in the old runtime: closure captures capped at 8 names until 2026-09-15, C loop lane bodies at 8 frame slots and 6 register slots, a JIT wait line of 64 definitions, a one-byte tag space recorded as full, and host doors reached as numbered modes of one leaf node. A census of 2026-08-03 counted 69 plus 9 environment switches.
