n: 3.7.3
name: asks
kind: hub
is: What the owner asked for between 2026-07-02 and 2026-11-20 as recorded in dated notes, and how the study reads that record: one constant direction, pursued as layered migrations while seed lines, band files and tracked files kept rising, and one tension between a system that does not refuse and a system that never recovers silently.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/lessons

n: 3.7.3.1
name: owner-direction
kind: observation
is: Dated notes record the owner's asks: core recipes in the language over a minimal C bootstrap (2026-09-12); one runtime, and repair the language instead of its use (09-15); node ids instead of serialising, and no child processes (10-04); no JSON inside (10-08, 10-12); rented tokens down 10 to 100 times (10-13); design the architecture once (11-12).
