n: 3.7.4.7
name: in-process-cells-and-node-queries
kind: observation
is: In the old body cell_run runs another unit in-process under its own deadline, a child's end is awaited through kqueue or a pidfd and answers nothing if no exit arrived in time, and telemetry crosses as shared-memory frames. With native pipes between the body's own tools (awk ... | sort) and two sentences in a review guide, a local model reviewed a 60-line table in 177 s, 8 turns and 0 repairs, against 18 turns and 9 repairs before.
status: observed
src: 2.1.6#86-88 2.1.6#1269-1272 2.1.6#1026-1029 2.1.6#1212-1214
